    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'RULES OF THE GAME

    A living cell with fewer than two living neighbours
    dies.

    A living cell with two or three living neighbours lives on.

    A
    living cell with more than three living neighbours dies.

    A dead cell with
    exactly three living neighbours comes alive.


    VERSUS

    Take turns placing
    squares on your half, then race the clock. New cells take the colour most of
    their parents share. When clusters of different colours touch, the bigger one
    converts the smaller. Most squares when time runs out wins.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 42ef9e72371064556a74a7ecea2903d3, type: 2}
